{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0542-bradleyterry-rankings-for-recommender-systems-across.md", "equation": "Rank centrality: P_{ij} = (1/(2nd))A_{ij}w̄_{ji} (i≠j), P_{ii} = 1 − (1/(2nd))Σ_{k≠i} A_{ik}w̄_{ki}; π̂ᵀP = π̂ᵀ; θ*_i = log π̂_i − (1/n)Σ_k π̂_k (under Σ_i θ*_i = 0).", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9127}
