{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0544-regularization-in-paired-comparison-models-via.md", "equation": "Calibration formula:** if a single observed win (no other info) should imply future-win probability q > 1/2, then q = (1+δ)/(1+2δ), i.e. **δ = (1−q)/(2q−1)** (Eq. 6). q = 0.99 → δ = 1/98.", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9127}
