{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0567-modelling-between-and-withinseason-trajectories-in.md", "equation": "Linear-model representation: y_{i,j} = B_{i,j}δ + X_{i,j}ζ + Z_{i,j}F_i + D_{i,j}β^{(i,j)} + (α/√(1+α²))z_{i,j} + ε*_{ij}; Lomax prior on λ_i^{−2}, τ_i², ψ_1^{−2}, ψ_2² via data augmentation (Makalic & Schmidt 2016): ψ_1²∼IG(1,1/ξ_1), λ_i²∼IG(1,1/ρ_i), ψ_2²∼IG(1,1/ξ_2), τ_i²∼IG(1,1/κ_i), ξ_1,ξ_2,ρ_i,κ_i∼IG(1/2,1).", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9127}
{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0567-modelling-between-and-withinseason-trajectories-in.md", "equation": "Joint block: MH-RW on (ψ_1²,ψ_2²) and (λ_i²,τ_i²) (M+1 blocks), likelihood marginalizing β^{(i)}, F_i, β^{(i,j)} with V_{i,j}=σ_i²diag(ω_{i,j})+ψ_1²λ_i²D_{i,j}^TD_{i,j}.", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9127}
{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0567-modelling-between-and-withinseason-trajectories-in.md", "equation": "ψ_1²,ψ_2² ∼ N(Q_1^{−1}(ΣU_{i,j}^TV_{i,j}^{−1}r_{i,j}), Q_1^{−1}), Q_1=ΣU_{i,j}^TV_{i,j}^{−1}U_{i,j}; β^{(i,j)} | · ∼ N(Q_2^{−1}(·),Q_2^{−1}), Q_2=(1/ψ_1²λ_i²)I_C+D_{i,j}^TW_{i,j}^{−1}D_{i,j}, W_{i,j}=σ_i²diag(ω_{i,j}).", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9127}
{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0567-modelling-between-and-withinseason-trajectories-in.md", "equation": "Skew-t augmentation: z_{i,j,k} ∼ truncated N on [0,∞); θ via MH-RW marginalizing ζ,δ; (ζ,δ)|· ∼ N(P^{−1}Q,P^{−1}); β^{(i)} ∼ N((1/Q_2)(1/ψ_2²τ_i² β + 1/ψ_1² Σ(1/λ_i²)β^{(i,j)}), (1/Q_2)I_C), Q_2=(1/ψ_2²τ_i² + 1/ψ_1² Σ(1/λ_i²)).", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9127}
{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0567-modelling-between-and-withinseason-trajectories-in.md", "equation": "Interweaving (Yu & Meng 2011): reparameterize h_{i,j}=β^{(i,j)}−β, sample (ζ,δ,β) ∼ N((P*)^{−1}Q*, (P*)^{−1}), then deterministic back-transform β^{(i,j)}←β^{(i,j)}+β−β_old, β^{(i)}←β^{(i)}+β−β_old.", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9127}
{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0567-modelling-between-and-withinseason-trajectories-in.md", "equation": "Observation model (Eq. 1): y_{i,j,k} = g(t_{i,j,k}) + f_{i,j}(t_{i,j,k}−a_i−j+1) + x_{i,j,k}ζ + ε_{i,j,k}, f_{i,j}(x) on (0,1) — the within-season fraction.", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9127}
