{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0567-modelling-between-and-withinseason-trajectories-in.md", "equation": "Within-season RBP (Eq. 3): h*_{i,j}(z)=Σ_{k=2}^{K}Σ_{v=1}^{k−1} β^{(i,j)}_{k,v} b_{k,v}(z), K=6, with b_{k,v}(z)=C(k,ν)z^ν(1−z)^{k−ν}.", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9127}
