{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0567-modelling-between-and-withinseason-trajectories-in.md", "equation": "Univariate summary measures (App. A proof): ∫_0^1 ε(z)dz = Σ_n (1/(n+1))Σ_v a_{n,v}; ∫_0^1 ε(z)²dz = Σ a_{n1,v1}a_{n2,v2} B_{n1,n2,v1,v2} with B_{n1,n2,v1,v2}=C(n1,v1)C(n2,v2)(v1+v2)!(n1+n2−v1−v2)!/(n1+n2+1)!.", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9127}
