{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0590-bayesian-inference-of-the-climbing-grade.md", "equation": "Success model (Eq. 1): Pr(y=1) = p_send = e^{mC(t)}/(e^{mC(t)} + e^{mR}), with C(t) climber grade, R route grade, m slope parameter.", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9127}
