{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0590-bayesian-inference-of-the-climbing-grade.md", "equation": "Expected failures before redpoint (Eq. 5): E[a] = (1 − p_send)/p_send — the odds-ratio of failure; e.g., 9 fails per send implies p_send = 1/(E[a]+1) = 0.1.", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9127}
