{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0591-an-elotype-rating-model-for-players.md", "equation": "Taylor (Jensen) correction — the paper's core formula (Eq. 6): ⟨S_ij⟩ ≈ b(θ_i − θ_j) + ½ b''(θ_i − θ_j)(σ_i² + σ_j²) =: b(θ_i−θ_j) + K(θ_i−θ_j, σ_i, σ_j), where K is odd in its first argument and even in the other two.", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9127}
